### Olga tries every dead code she might hold. Spec §6.4: a dead invitation answers one way, whatever killed it —
### otherwise the answer tells a holder that a code was real, or that its owner revoked it.

### Used up: Theo's, accepted once, `maxUses` 1
# @name UsedUp
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [404]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/invitations/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{OlgaAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{TheoInviteCode}}" }

